/*
This code was created to gather properties from the device and then save them to the SV.
Then we're sending requests to /monitorings API for SV-monitoring values of last (7 days).
We're feeding the kladri with the properties from the monitoring.
We save the kladri output to SV and they also become monitored.

Configuration set values:

cemKladriHealthScoreUrl -> healthScore external endpoint
cemKladriHealthScoreLogin, cemKladriHealthScorePassword -> external endpoint credentials
cemHealthScoreMonitoringRange -> range of monitoring data to be fetched (in days)
*/

